  {
   "vo": "But here's the problem. His IPL strike rate was just under one-twenty. And the game has changed. In two thousand eight, top-order batters struck at one-thirty. By twenty twenty-five, that number had jumped past one-fifty-eight. The powerplay went from seven runs an over to more than nine.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "bars",
    "head": {
     "t": "THE PROBLEM",
     "sub": "STRIKE RATE · RUNS PER 100 BALLS"
    },
    "max": 170,
