  {
   "vo": "So would सचिन have survived? Look closer. In one-day cricket, he struck at eighty-six, far quicker than most of his era. शारजाह. Nineteen ninety-eight. He took apart Australia in a desert storm.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "list",
    "head": {
     "t": "THE CASE FOR SACHIN"
    },
