  {
   "vo": "Now give him flat pitches, bigger bats, and an Impact Player batting behind him. Scale his IPL numbers to today's game, and his strike rate climbs to around one-forty-six. That's an opener who wins you the powerplay without giving away his wicket.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "bignum",
    "head": {
     "t": "ADJUST FOR THE ERA"
    },
    "from": 119.8,
    "value": 146,
    "label": "ERA-ADJUSTED STRIKE RATE",
