   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "The verdict? Modern T20 सचिन isn't a slogger. He's the anchor who scores at a run a ball, and then explodes. And with a technique like that, he might just be the most complete T20 batter we never got to see.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "statement",
    "kicker": "OUR VERDICT",
